{"seq":6,"slug":"ai-assisted-code-review-quality","title":"AI 辅助代码评审与质量门禁","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-native-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality","rating":{"composite":4.33,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-辅助代码评审与质量门禁-简介\">AI 辅助代码评审与质量门禁 简介</h1><p>当 AI 大量生成代码，评审就从「流程里的一环」变成了「决定质量与吞吐的关口」：每一行合入的代码都要有人理解、认可、负责，而生成的速度远超人逐行审查的速度。本 hub 讲两件相辅相成的事：一是<strong>用 AI 辅助评审</strong>——让 AI 做第一遍审查，缓解人的评审压力，同时用实证数据认清它能抓什么、抓不住什么；二是<strong>质量门禁</strong>——把测试、类型、lint、CI 与分支规则做成机器执行的闸门，让放手用 AI 变得安全。贯穿全篇的主线是：AI 辅助评审 + 自动质量门禁共同缓解「评审成为瓶颈」的压力，但「理解、判断、对结果负责」这条线始终在人手里——AI 帮你审得更快，但不替你负责。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想解决的问题</th>\n<th>应去的兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>本 hub 怎么处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>怎么把「要做什么」写成可验证的规格，让 AI 少猜少返工</td>\n<td>03 规格驱动开发与 AI</td>\n<td>本 hub 只拿现成的规格当评审参照物——第 4 章意图违背检测所对照的规格，从那边来</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整个研发生命周期（规划 → 设计 → 实现 → 测试 → 交付）如何随 AI 重排，团队怎么协作</td>\n<td>05 AI 增强的研发生命周期与团队流程</td>\n<td>本 hub 只深钻其中「评审 + 质量」这一个环节的方法论与机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>git 安全网、原子提交、PR 该多小、描述怎么写、agent 怎么安全提交</td>\n<td>11 AI 原生 Git 工作流</td>\n<td>本 hub 不讲提交与历史纪律，只讲 PR 流程里的审查方法与合入前的验证门禁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试本身怎么写得好：快、可读、可信、能当 agent 的自我纠错回路</td>\n<td>13 AI 友好的测试</td>\n<td>本 hub 把测试当作合入前的一道闸来布置与强制执行，不教写测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话判据：问题落在「这次改动该不该合入、谁来审、拿什么挡住坏代码」上，读本 hub；落在写出好规格、重排整个研发流程、git 提交纪律或测试编写本身上，去对应的兄弟 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>四章是递进关系：第 1 章建立问题意识（为什么评审成了关口），第 2 章讲怎么用 AI 分担评审（能力边界与陷阱），第 3 章讲自动化门禁怎么搭（分层、三类确定性检查、CI 与合入策略），第 4 章讲长期运转（抓意图违背、守住人的问责、持续演进）。首次接触建议按序通读；不同人群可按下面的路线取侧重：</p>\n<h3 id=\"团队负责人-工程效能负责人-决策要不要引入-ai-评审-怎么立规矩\">团队负责人 / 工程效能负责人（决策要不要引入 AI 评审、怎么立规矩）</h3><ol>\n<li>读<a href=\"review-in-the-ai-era/why-review-matters-more\">为什么评审在 AI 时代更重要</a>建立瓶颈意识，再读<a href=\"review-in-the-ai-era/what-ai-review-can-and-cannot-do\">AI 评审能做什么不能做什么</a>校准对工具能力的期望；</li>\n<li>读<a href=\"using-ai-to-review/avoiding-review-pitfalls\">避免评审的陷阱</a>与<a href=\"sustaining-quality-with-ai/keeping-humans-accountable\">保持人的最终问责</a>——这两篇回答「放开之后靠什么不出事」；</li>\n<li>用<a href=\"sustaining-quality-with-ai/evolving-review-and-gates\">演进评审与门禁</a>收尾，理解门禁体系为什么要当活系统运营。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"一线工程师-每天审-ai-生成的-pr-或用-ai-辅助自己评审\">一线工程师（每天审 AI 生成的 PR、或用 AI 辅助自己评审）</h3><ol>\n<li>第 2 章按序精读：<a href=\"using-ai-to-review/what-ai-catches-well\">AI 擅长抓什么</a>、<a href=\"using-ai-to-review/reviewing-ai-generated-code\">评审 AI 生成的代码</a>——后者是你日常动线上最直接的一篇；</li>\n<li>回到第 1 章读<a href=\"review-in-the-ai-era/human-and-ai-reviewers-together\">人与 AI 评审者协同</a>，把自己放进三层接力流程里找准位置；</li>\n<li>按需查阅<a href=\"sustaining-quality-with-ai/intent-violations-and-spec-checks\">意图违背与对照规格</a>：审「代码对不对」之外的另一半职责——「做的是不是要求的事」。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"平台-devops-工程师-要把质量要求固化成仓库级机制的人\">平台 / DevOps 工程师（要把质量要求固化成仓库级机制的人）</h3><ol>\n<li>直奔第 3 章：<a href=\"quality-gates-and-automation/layered-quality-gates\">分层的质量门禁</a>定框架，<a href=\"quality-gates-and-automation/tests-types-lint-as-gates\">测试类型与 lint 作为门禁</a>选检查，<a href=\"quality-gates-and-automation/ci-and-merge-policies\">CI 与合入策略</a>落强制力；</li>\n<li>第 3 章三篇里都埋着失效模式线索（门禁剧场、flaky 侵蚀、绕行文化），读时留意收集；再以<a href=\"sustaining-quality-with-ai/evolving-review-and-gates\">演进评审与门禁</a>收束，把「建起来」延伸为「养下去」。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>PR 与代码评审的基本流程</strong>：知道 PR 是什么、评审大致怎么做、CI 状态检查意味着什么。本 hub 从这些出发，不从零教流程。</li>\n<li><strong>测试 / lint / 类型检查的使用经验</strong>：跑过单元测试、见过 lint 报错即可，不需要精通任何具体工具。</li>\n<li><strong>git 基础操作</strong>：branch / merge / revert 的概念，理解「合入主干」意味着什么。</li>\n<li><strong>用过至少一种 AI 编码工具</strong>：了解 Copilot 类助手会生成大段代码、产出可能「几乎对但不完全对」——这是全篇一切讨论的现实背景。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>以下为本目录内相邻 hub 的可选探索入口。本 hub 内容自包含，不依赖这些阅读；需要更宽视角时再进入：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../spec-driven-development-with-ai/\">03 规格驱动开发与 AI</a>：本 hub 第 4 章对照所用的规格怎么写出来，答案在那边。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ai-augmented-sdlc/\">05 AI 增强的研发生命周期与团队流程</a>：把评审这一环放回整个 SDLC 与团队协作的全景图。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/\">10 Lint 与格式化作为 Agent 护栏</a>：门禁里跑得最频繁的那类检查，如何设计成对 agent 真正有效的护栏。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ai-native-git-workflow/\">11 AI 原生的 Git 工作流</a>：PR 之前的半场——提交粒度、分支隔离与 agent 安全提交的纪律。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ai-friendly-testing/\">13 AI 友好的测试</a>：把门禁里最重要的那道闸——测试——写成 agent 能用的验证回路。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../human-ai-collaboration/\">26 人机协作开发模式</a>：本 hub「人守最终问责」背后的协作模式全景。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"review-in-the-ai-era","title":"Review In The Ai Era","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/review-in-the-ai-era","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-review-matters-more","title":"为什么评审在 AI 时代更重要","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/review-in-the-ai-era/why-review-matters-more"},{"seq":2,"slug":"what-ai-review-can-and-cannot-do","title":"AI 评审能做什么不能做什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/review-in-the-ai-era/what-ai-review-can-and-cannot-do"},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-and-ai-reviewers-together","title":"人与 AI 评审者协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/review-in-the-ai-era/human-and-ai-reviewers-together"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"using-ai-to-review","title":"Using Ai To Review","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/using-ai-to-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-ai-catches-well","title":"AI 擅长抓什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/using-ai-to-review/what-ai-catches-well"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reviewing-ai-generated-code","title":"评审 AI 生成的代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/using-ai-to-review/reviewing-ai-generated-code"},{"seq":3,"slug":"avoiding-review-pitfalls","title":"避免评审的陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/using-ai-to-review/avoiding-review-pitfalls"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-gates-and-automation","title":"Quality Gates And Automation","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/quality-gates-and-automation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"layered-quality-gates","title":"分层的质量门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/quality-gates-and-automation/layered-quality-gates"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tests-types-lint-as-gates","title":"测试类型与 lint 作为门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/quality-gates-and-automation/tests-types-lint-as-gates"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-and-merge-policies","title":"CI 与合入策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/quality-gates-and-automation/ci-and-merge-policies"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"sustaining-quality-with-ai","title":"Sustaining Quality With Ai","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/sustaining-quality-with-ai","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intent-violations-and-spec-checks","title":"意图违背与对照规格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/sustaining-quality-with-ai/intent-violations-and-spec-checks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"keeping-humans-accountable","title":"保持人的最终问责","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/sustaining-quality-with-ai/keeping-humans-accountable"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evolving-review-and-gates","title":"演进评审与门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/sustaining-quality-with-ai/evolving-review-and-gates"}]}]}